    "description": {
      "en": "Original low-poly direction: establish elongated flattened body with front and rear cap shells joined by tiled sclerites in the blockout, then preserve the largest silhouette breaks and openings. Simplify fine ornament and repeated elements without copying reference meshes; palette and presentation are artistic choices, not fossil evidence.",
